- Your assessment of our case strength and a realistic outcome range if we go to hearing.
- Your estimate of additional fees/costs to take this to hearing/trial.
- The likelihood of collecting any judgment or enforcing a settlement.
- Any local rules or judge-specific procedures in Maricopa County we should prepare for.
- Recommended negotiation strategy and whether mediation or another alternative makes sense.
- What you need from me (documents, witnesses, timeline) and upcoming deadlines.

I’ve started gathering documents and can send a one-page timeline and the discovery folder before our meeting. Please let me know 2–3 times that work for you this week.

Thanks,
