3. Is the current settlement offer reasonable compared to trial (please include attorney fees and enforcement costs)?
4. Recommended counter-offer or settlement language (including payment schedule, security, interest, releases).
5. Estimated additional attorney fees and timeline to hearing/trial and to final resolution.
6. Any pre-hearing filings, witness prep, or exhibits you think we must have ready.

I can meet/call at [two time slots]. Thanks — I want to make a timely, informed decision.

Next steps I can help with
- Draft that email or phone script tailored to your situation
