12. Are there any pending deadlines, pretrial filings, witness/exhibit disclosures, or settlement conference dates I should know about?
13. What evidence or witnesses would be determinative at trial? How prepared are those witnesses?
14. If we go to trial and lose, what are our options for appeal or modification? What are the costs and likelihood of success on appeal?
